IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ktv-nouns`
IMPORT `ktv-annex1-definitions`
IMPORT `ktv-part3-exclusions-and-termination`

-- Article 23: for every exclusion, one fact pattern that triggers it and one near miss that does
-- not (src 691-762). The near miss for a cause is the same event with that cause absent; for the
-- fraud limbs, an act that is neither of the two acts Annex 1 calls fraud (src 1514-1528).

§ `Tests — Article 23, each exclusion triggered and missed`

GIVEN `p fraud`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `p alcohol`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `p narcotics` IS A BOOLEAN
      `p medicine`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `p fighting`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `p injury`    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Circumstances of the insured event`
`an event caused by: fraud` `p fraud` `alcohol` `p alcohol` `narcotics` `p narcotics` `medicine` `p medicine` `fighting` `p fighting` `self-injury` `p injury` MEANS `Circumstances of the insured event` WITH
    `suicide by the insured`                                                IS FALSE
    `acts of insurance fraud`                                               IS LIST (`Act of insurance fraud` WITH `committed by` IS `the insured, as fraudster`, `using forged documents or deliberately falsifying the claim file` IS `p fraud`, `harming the life or health of the insured to claim a benefit` IS FALSE)
    `a breach of the law on alcohol concentration`                          IS `p alcohol`
    `use of narcotics without a doctor's prescription`                      IS `p narcotics`
    `use of medicine without a doctor's prescription`                       IS `p medicine`
    `fighting or resisting arrest by a competent authority`                 IS `p fighting`
    `self-inflicted injury`                                                 IS `p injury`
    `a sport or recreational activity`                                      IS NOTHING
    `air travel`                                                            IS FALSE
    `as passenger or crew on a licensed, regularly scheduled commercial flight` IS FALSE

`the policy` MEANS Policy WITH
    `effective date`                           IS YMD 2022 3 15
    `date the Company accepted the insurance`  IS YMD 2022 3 20
    `date of the latest reinstatement`         IS NOTHING
    `premium frequency`                        IS `yearly`
    `the insured`                              IS `Insured person` WITH `date of birth` IS YMD 1980 6 10, `sex` IS `male`, `living in Vietnam when the application was submitted` IS TRUE, `one in whom the policyowner has an insurable interest` IS TRUE, `accepted for insurance by the Company` IS TRUE
    `the policyowner`                          IS Policyowner WITH `kind` IS `an individual`, `age in completed years` IS 42, `full civil legal capacity` IS TRUE, `lawfully established and operating in Vietnam` IS FALSE, `alive` IS TRUE

`nothing` MEANS `an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE

§§ `Article 23(b) — TPD (src 731-748)`

#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` `nothing`
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` TRUE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` TRUE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` TRUE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` TRUE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` TRUE)
-- Medicine without a prescription is not in the TPD list: a near miss for (iii).
#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(b) — the TPD benefit is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` TRUE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)

§§ `Article 23(c) — cancer and critical illness, after the waiting period (src 752-762)`

#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` `nothing`
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` TRUE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` TRUE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` TRUE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` TRUE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` TRUE)
-- Fighting is not in the cancer and critical-illness list: a near miss.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 23(c) — under` `the policy` `, a cancer or critical-illness benefit for a diagnosis on` (YMD 2025 1 1) `is excluded, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` TRUE `self-injury` FALSE)

§§ `Article 23(a) — death (src 691-725)`

-- Fraud by the insured ends the contract with the account value; an act that is not fraud does not.
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` TRUE `alcohol` FALSE `narcotics` FALSE `medicine` FALSE `fighting` FALSE `self-injury` FALSE) EQUALS `the contract ends and the contract account value at death is paid`
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, given` `nothing` EQUALS `the death benefit is paid`
-- Alcohol, narcotics, fighting and self-injury are not death exclusions.
#ASSERT `Article 23(a) — under` `the policy` `, the outcome of a death on` (YMD 2030 1 1) `, given` (`an event caused by: fraud` FALSE `alcohol` TRUE `narcotics` TRUE `medicine` TRUE `fighting` TRUE `self-injury` TRUE) EQUALS `the death benefit is paid`
